S1473-3099(21)00191-2.">[19]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-31"><a href="#ist-24" title="Wahab A, Sanborn D, Vergidis P, et al. Diagnosis and Prevention of Invasive Fungal Infections in the Immunocompromised Host. Chest. 2025;167(2):374-386. doi:10.1016/j.chest.2024.08.046.">[24]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-32"><a href="#ist-25" title="Galgiani JN, Kauffman CA. Coccidioidomycosis and Histoplasmosis in Immunocompetent Persons. The New England Journal of Medicine. 2024;390(6):536-547. doi:10.1056/NEJMra2306821.">[25]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-33"><a href="#ist-26" title="Jones HE. Immune Response and Host Resistance of Humans to Dermatophyte Infection. Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology. 1993;28(5 Pt 1):S12-S18. doi:10.1016/s0190-9622(09)80302-2.">[26]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-34"><a href="#ist-27" title="Burstein VL, Beccacece I, Guasconi L, et al. Skin Immunity to Dermatophytes: From Experimental Infection Models to Human Disease. Frontiers in Immunology. 2020;11:605644. doi:10.3389/fimmu.2020.605644.">[27]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-35"><a href="#ist-28" title="Cornely OA, Sprute R, Bassetti M, et al. Global Guideline for the Diagnosis and Management of Candidiasis: An Initiative of the ECMM in Cooperation With ISHAM and ASM. The Lancet. Infectious Diseases. 2025;25(5):e280-e293. doi:10.1016/S1473-3099(24)00749-7.">[28]</a></sup></caption>
