      <td>При отрубевидном лишае — 300 мг 1 р/нед 2–4 нед <sup id="ssylka-192"><a href="#ist-65" title="Lesher JL. Oral Therapy of Common Superficial Fungal Infections of the Skin. Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology. 1999;40(6 Pt 2):S31-4. doi:10.1016/s0190-9622(99)70395-6.">[65]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-193"><a href="#ist-57" title="Hu SW, Bigby M. Pityriasis Versicolor: A Systematic Review of Interventions. Archives of Dermatology. 2010;146(10):1132-40. doi:10.1001/archdermatol.2010.259.">[57]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-194"><a href="#ist-62" title="Gupta AK, MacLeod MA, Foley KA, Gupta G, Friedlander SF. Fungal Skin Infections. Pediatrics in Review. 2017;38(1):8-22. doi:10.1542/pir.2015-0140.">[62]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-195"><a href="#ist-48" title="Chang CH, Stein SL. Malassezia-Associated Skin Diseases in the Pediatric Population. Pediatric Dermatology. 2024 Sep-Oct;41(5):769-779. doi:10.1111/pde.15603.">[48]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-196"><a href="#ist-106" title="Food and Drug Administration. Fluconazole. 2026.">[106]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-197"><a href="#ist-107" title="Food and Drug Administration. Fluconazole. 2024.">[107]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-198"><a href="#ist-108" title="Gupta AK, Kohli Y, Batra R. In Vitro Activities of Posaconazole, Ravuconazole, Terbinafine, Itraconazole and Fluconazole Against Dermatophyte, Yeast and Non-Dermatophyte Species. Medical Mycology. 2005;43(2):179-85. doi:10.1080/13693780410001731583.">[108]</a></sup></td>
