      <td>Итраконазол</td>
      <td>Дерматофиты, дрожжи, плесени</td>
      
      <td>При отрубевидном лишае — 200 мг/сут 5–7 дней; вторая линия при онихомикозе <sup id="ssylka-199"><a href="#ist-65" title="Lesher JL. Oral Therapy of Common Superficial Fungal Infections of the Skin. Journal of the American Academy of Dermatology. 1999;40(6 Pt 2):S31-4. doi:10.1016/s0190-9622(99)70395-6.">[65]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-200"><a href="#ist-57" title="Hu SW, Bigby M. Pityriasis Versicolor: A Systematic Review of Interventions. Archives of Dermatology. 2010;146(10):1132-40. doi:10.1001/archdermatol.2010.259.">[57]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-201"><a href="#ist-62" title="Gupta AK, MacLeod MA, Foley KA, Gupta G, Friedlander SF. Fungal Skin Infections. Pediatrics in Review. 2017;38(1):8-22. doi:10.1542/pir.2015-0140.">[62]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-202"><a href="#ist-48" title="Chang CH, Stein SL. Malassezia-Associated Skin Diseases in the Pediatric Population. Pediatric Dermatology. 2024 Sep-Oct;41(5):769-779. doi:10.1111/pde.15603.">[48]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-203"><a href="#ist-83" title="Kreijkamp-Kaspers S, Hawke K, Guo L, et al. Oral Antifungal Medication for Toenail Onychomycosis. The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews. 2017;7:CD010031. doi:10.1002/14651858.CD010031.pub2.">[83]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-204"><a href="#ist-99" title="Kreijkamp-Kaspers S, Hawke KL, van Driel ML. Oral Medications to Treat Toenail Fungal Infection. Jama. 2018;319(4):397-398. doi:10.1001/jama.2017.20160.">[99]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-205"><a href="#ist-109" title="Gupta AK, Stec N, Bamimore MA, et al. The Efficacy and Safety of Pulse vs. Continuous Therapy for Dermatophyte Toenail Onychomycosis. Journal of the European Academy of Dermatology and Venereology : JEADV. 2020;34(3):580-588. doi:10.1111/jdv.16101.">[109]</a></sup><sup id="ssylka-206"><a href="#ist-110" title="Koshy A, Kamath A. Antifungal Pulse Therapy for Onychomycosis: A Narrative Review. European Journal of Clinical Pharmacology. 2026;82(10):257. doi:10.1007/s00228-026-04187-4.">[110]</a></sup></td>
